<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus Lombard NatWest doubles 96 pre-tax profits.</title>
<headline>Cyprus Lombard NatWest doubles 96 pre-tax profits.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>				 (In millions of Cyprus pounds)</p>
<p>				  1996		 1995</p>
<p>    Customer deposits     190.0	     146.0</p>
<p>    Advances		  144.0	     106.0</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   3.28		1.64</p>
<p>Note : Profit before tax for 1996 included a one-off item of 1.01 million pounds associated with the liquidation of shares, board of directors chairman Michael Colocassides said.</p>
<p>National Westminster Bank owns 75 percent of Lombard NatWest in Cyprus.</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
</text>
